<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>Privacy Policy - Krishna Contest 2026</title>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a237e 0%, #0d47a1 50%, #01579b 100%); min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
        .navbar { background: rgba(13, 19, 38, 0.95); padding: 18px 0; }
        .navbar-content { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 30px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; }
        .logo-container { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; text-decoration: none; }
        .logo-img { width: 50px; height: 50px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #ffd700; }
        .logo-text { font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd700 0%, #ffb300 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; }
        .main-content { flex: 1; padding: 40px 20px; }
        .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; background: white; border-radius: 25px; overflow: hidden; }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a237e 0%, #283593 100%); color: white; padding: 40px; text-align: center; }
        .header h1 { font-size: 32px; }
        .content { padding: 50px; }
        .content p, .content ul { color: #37474f; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .section h3 { color: #1a237e; font-size: 20px; margin: 30px 0 15px; }
        .footer { background: rgba(13, 19, 38, 0.95); padding: 25px; text-align: center; border-top: 2px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.2); }
        .footer p { color: #b0bec5; font-size: 14px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar">
        <div class="navbar-content">
            <a href="/" class="logo-container">
                <img src="/lord_krishna.avif" alt="Krishna" class="logo-img" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
                <div class="logo-text">Krishna Contest 2026</div>
            </a>
        </div>
    </nav>
    <div class="main-content">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">
                <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
                <p>Last Updated: February 2026</p>
            </div>
            <div class="content">
                <p>We are committed to protecting your personal information and your right to privacy.</p>
                <div class="section">
                    <h3>Information We Collect</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Personal Information: Name, email, phone number, payment details</li>
                        <li>Contest Submissions: Artwork, essays, recordings</li>
                        <li>Technical Data: IP address, browser type, device information</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="section">
                    <h3>How We Use Your Information</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>To process your registration and participation</li>
                        <li>To communicate contest updates</li>
                        <li>To process payments securely</li>
                        <li>To evaluate submissions and determine winners</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="section">
                    <h3>Data Security</h3>
                    <p>We implement industry-standard security measures. All data is encrypted during transmission using SSL/TLS protocols.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="section">
                    <h3>Contact Us</h3>
                    <p>Email: support@krishnacontest.org | Phone: +91-XXXXXXXXXX</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <footer class="footer">
        <p>© 2026 Krishna Contest. All Rights Reserved.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
